  "title": "United Bank Celebrates 186 Years of Service",
  "summary": "United Bank’s story began on March 17, 1839. In the 186 years that followed, it has grown to a premier banking company with a strong presence throughout the Mid-Atlantic and Southeast. In honor of the Bank’s anniversary, United will carry on its long-standing tradition of celebrating with its customers at local branches on St. Patrick’s Day, a holiday the Bank enjoys sharing.",
